    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When Toshi finally walks out of prison, Muranishi is waiting at the gate ready to team up again. They head straight to a studio where their old colleague Kawada is editing video and ask him to quit his job on the spot and come to Tokyo. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よう、おっさん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "先に出て悪かったな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ、大差ねえだろ？おい、次は何やるんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺たちがやるって言ったら、エロに決まってんだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
